@startuml
[*] --> "Waiting for User Input"
"Waiting for User Input" --> "Processing Input" : User starts typing
"Processing Input" --> "Suggesting Existing Options" : Input exists in database
"Processing Input" --> "Suggesting New Options" : Input does not exist in database
"Suggesting Existing Options" --> [*] : User selects suggestion or cancels
"Suggesting New Options" --> [*] : User selects suggestion or cancels
@enduml
